"P2442186073" "Thank you, {HeroName}. I don't mind telling you, until you showed up I wasn't sure I had a prayer of saving Salamanca. Now, I know there's at least a chance."
// RandomFameString :
"P1252794630" "I hear {HeroName} took on a whole nest of those awful Tuatha creatures!"

