// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P767705509" "I've heard several eyewitness reports of Tuatha de Dannan roaming around Salamanca.  My people aren't safe, and I can't fix this on my own. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you expel the Tuatha from the village, {HeroName}?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1950048182" "Expel the Tuatha from the village"
// SendOffString :
"P3888708712" "According to the reports, the Tuatha are usually found near the lake and on the western side of town."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1306162775" "Combat Tuatha in Salamanca"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P777233377" "On the behalf of all Salamanca, I thank you. I don't know how we'd defend ourselves without you around."

