"P57849896" "You decreased the number of Tuatha de Dannan in the village."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2626285664" "I'm beginning to believe you may save Salamanca from the foul creatures that menace us.  It means a lot to me, {HeroName}.  More than you may realize."
// RandomFameString :
"P3840042371" "{HeroName} is making a real splash in Salamanca!"

