// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2898466937" "The Tuatha de Dannan and the Fir Bolg seem to be locked in some kind of eternal battle.  I don't know what caused it or what keeps it going, but I know that my people have nothing to do with it!  Of course, try explaining that to a 12-foot walking pumpkin.  We've had a lot of people caught in the crossfire these last few months, and more deaths than I care to remember. <br><br>I've just received word that some of the Fir Bolg managed to get into a local warehouse, and the Tuatha cornered them there. The worst part is, there are still people inside. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to get in there and get those citizens out of the line of fire.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P542346540" "Get the citizens out of the line of fire"
// SendOffString :
"P3982401019" "You can take on the Fir Bolg and the Tuatha if you want to, but I'm more concerned with the lives of my citizens.  Please make them your first priority."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3117999289" "Rescue trapped citizens"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1364810312" "There are still people trapped in that building, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3272113089" "A broken jack-o-lantern lies on the ground, no doubt a casualty of the Tuatha's battle with the Fir Bolg."

