// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1463023295" "I know you've seen the ghosts that roam Salamanca these days.  Until recently, they were the very people I am trying to save!  The war between the Tuatha de Dannan and the Fir Bolg often spills into our city streets, and sometimes my citizens pay the price.  The ghosts are the result. <br><br>I've been told that some of these pitiful spirits have found their way into an office here in Salamanca. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you go lay those poor creatures to rest?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1964334932" "Lay the ghosts to rest"
// SendOffString :
"P1985967337" "Those ghosts used to be my friends and neighbors, {HeroName}.  I only hope that by removing them from this world, you can bring them some peace."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P851687999" "Lay all ghosts to rest"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3952493436" "I'm still hearing reports of unearthly howling coming from that office building.  It sounds like there are still a few ghosts inside."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2500368421" "A long, miserable howl floats on the air."

