// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2521805678" "Hey, hey, {HeroName}!  I've heard a lot about you in these parts.  I make it my business to keep myself informed.  I think I can tell you a lot about this mystical disturbance, but first, there's work to do.  This little doohickey's called a divining rod.  It absorbs the essence of ghosts, and when it does so, believe it or not, it learns.  It'll help us figure out if anything strange is going on with the ghosts.  Anything stranger than normal, that is.  Just don't ask where I got it.  And if you happen to see Azuria... don't mention that I have it, ok?"

